一、定义 / Definitions

1.1 “软件”指 Jpg-Raw-Pair-Cleaner 的源代码、文档、图标、示例及其他随附文件，以及作者后续发布的本软件版本。
“Software” means the source code, documentation, icons, examples and other accompanying files of Jpg-Raw-Pair-Cleaner, and later versions released by the Author.

1.2 “衍生作品”指基于软件的全部或部分源代码进行修改、翻译、改编、组合、拆分、再开发或以其他方式形成的软件、产品、服务、文档或作品。
“Derivative Work” means any software, product, service, document or work created by modifying, translating, adapting, combining, extracting, redeveloping or otherwise using all or part of the Software.

1.3 “商业使用”指以营利为目的或直接/间接获取经济利益的使用，包括销售、许可、付费分发、收费服务、以软件为主要功能收费、广告变现，以及通过衍生作品获取收入。
“Commercial Use” means use for profit or direct/indirect financial gain, including sale, licensing, paid distribution, paid services, charging for software-based functionality, advertising revenue, and monetizing Derivative Works.

1.4 “作者”指 KILL-STAR SX。
“Author” means KILL-STAR SX.

1.5 “书面许可”包括纸质文件、电子邮件、GitHub Issue 中作者的明确书面同意，或其他可留存记录的书面形式。
“Written permission” includes signed documents, email, the Author's explicit written consent in a GitHub Issue, or another written form that can be retained as a record.

