4.1 你应提前通知作者，并取得作者明确的书面同意，方可使用本软件的全部或部分源代码开发、发布、分发、部署或运营任何衍生作品，或将本软件用于开发新软件、产品或服务。
You must notify the Author in advance and obtain the Author's explicit written consent before using all or part of the Software to develop, publish, distribute, deploy or operate any Derivative Work, or to develop any new software, product or service.

4.2 经作者书面同意后，衍生作品可以采用闭源方式发布，但必须同时满足：
(a) 遵守第三条署名要求；
(b) 遵守第五条商业使用与收费规则；
(c) 遵守第六条专利限制；
(d) 遵守第七条合法使用要求；
(e) 在书面同意范围内使用，不得超出作者同意的范围。
A Derivative Work may be released as closed source only with the Author's written consent, and must:
(a) comply with Section 3 (Attribution);
(b) comply with Section 5 (Commercial Use and Fees);
(c) comply with Section 6 (Patent Restrictions);
(d) comply with Section 7 (Lawful Use);
(e) stay within the scope of the Author's written consent.

4.3 提前通知是申请许可的必要步骤，但仅通知、抄送或说明本身不构成同意；必须取得作者明确的书面同意。作者有权拒绝或附加条件。
Advance notice is a required step for seeking permission, but notice, copy or explanation alone does not constitute consent; the Author's explicit written consent is required. The Author may refuse or attach conditions.

