5.4 不收费的商业使用被允许，但仍须遵守第三条署名、第六条专利限制和第七条合法使用要求。
Commercial Use without charging fees is permitted, but must still comply with Section 3 (Attribution), Section 6 (Patent Restrictions) and Section 7 (Lawful Use).

